          </div>
          {#- Svenskans tredje ruta säger "Swish", som bara finns i Sverige.
              Ersatt med priset, som är sant på alla marknader och redan
              påstås i FAQ:n. -#}
          <div class="stat">
            <div class="num" style="font-size:46px">Free</div>
            <div class="label">Every format and the settlement included</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW IT WORKS -->
    <section class="steps">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">How it works</span>
          <h2>Three steps, no paper</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps-grid reveal">
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">01</div>
            <h3>Add the group</h3>
            <p>Pick the course and 2 to 4 players. Choose a format, or let the app suggest one. You set the stake once.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">02</div>
            <h3>Score the round</h3>
            <p>Tap in the strokes hole by hole. The app works out points, strokes and the leader in real time, with the right handicap for each player.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <div class="step-num">03</div>
            <h3>Square up</h3>
            <p>When you walk off, the app works out who owes whom and reduces it to as few payments as possible. No disputes at the 19th.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- REVIEWS -->
    <!-- Alla tre = verifierade 5-stjärniga App Store-recensioner. Citaten är
    ÖVERSATTA från den publicerade svenska texten, vilket noteras i UI:t —
    en översatt recension är inte längre ordagrant vad personen skrev.
    Eric J Karlsson · Nacka Golf, Taashiie/Natasha · Troxhammar GK, Buffshady/Philip · Golfstar.
    Kontrollera mot itunes.apple.com/se/rss/customerreviews/id=6767638917/sortBy=mostRecent/json -->
    <section class="voices">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="head reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">From the group</span>
          <h2>Golfers who have stopped counting by hand</h2>
        </div>
        {% macro stars() %}<div class="voice-stars" role="img" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">{% for i in range(5) %}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 17.27L18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg>{% endfor %}</div>{% endmacro %}
        <div class="voices-grid reveal">
          <figure class="voice">
            <blockquote>Works well with lots of formats, and the settlement at the end of the round is seamless.</blockquote>
            <figcaption>{{ stars() }}<span class="v-name">Eric K.</span><span class="v-meta">Nacka Golf · App Store</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="voice">
            <blockquote>Good, fun app! Loads of different game formats.</blockquote>
            <figcaption>{{ stars() }}<span class="v-name">Natasha</span><span class="v-meta">Troxhammar GK · App Store</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure class="voice">
            <blockquote>Really good fun! Very innovative.</blockquote>
            <figcaption>{{ stars() }}<span class="v-name">Philip</span><span class="v-meta">Golfstar · App Store</span></figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <p class="voices-note" style="text-align:center;color:#888;font-size:13px;margin-top:18px">Verified App Store reviews, translated from Swedish.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURES -->
    <div id="funktioner"></div>
    <section class="feature">
      <div class="wrap feature-inner reveal">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">The scorecard</span>
          <h2>Score the round, hole by hole</h2>
          <p>The whole group on one scorecard. Par as a faint guide, birdie and bogey markings in the classic style, and a leaderboard that updates while you play. No more losing count at the 14th.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-shot">
          <img src="{% shot "live" %}" alt="Live scorecard" loading="lazy" width="640" height="1306">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature">
      <div class="wrap feature-inner reveal">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">The settlement</span>
          <h2>Who owes whom, worked out</h2>
          <p>When the round ends the app works out the net for each player and reduces it all to as few payments as possible. No disputes at the 19th.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-shot">
          <img src="{% shot "settlement" %}" alt="Automatic settlement" loading="lazy" width="640" height="1306">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feature">
      <div class="wrap feature-inner reveal">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">The season</span>
          <h2>The rivalry lives on between rounds</h2>
          <p>A season balance, a leaderboard and a feed where you follow your friends' rounds in real time. Cheer from the sofa, and see who is up when the year is totted up.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-shot">
          <img src="{% shot "home" %}" alt="Season balance and leaderboard" loading="lazy" width="640" height="1306">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

